<title>BAHRAIN: PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Nov 10.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Bahrain - Nov 10.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are some of the leading stories in the Bahraini press on Sunday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>GULF DAILY NEWS</p>
<p>- Bahrain Monetary Agency annual report shows a 1995 trade surplus for the first time since 1991. Report puts surplus at 157 million dinars.</p>
<p>- Syria posts 12 percent jump in exports last year compared to 1994, official report says.</p>
<p>AKHBAR AL KHALEEJ</p>
<p>- State security court jails three Bahrainis for arson attack on electricity sub-station.</p>
